    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the BOSSFIGHT when you win!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenge yourself (literally!) as you try to one-up your previous party each time though this sidescrolling turn-based roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Outsmart enemy intents in a series of tactical combat encounters while assembling synergistic item builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover the nuances in this highly replayable game, lovingly designed to minimize complexity and maximize depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.poster.avif?t=1753466427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.webm?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.mp4?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Items, items, items!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In Bossfight Tactics, it's all about the items; there are no character classes/abilities/stats/etc!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Items let you move, attack, gain passive abilities and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With 100+ unique and quirky items, there are tons of emergent interactions to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.poster.avif?t=1753466427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.webm?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.mp4?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Instead of fixed movesets, enemies are equipped with random items which drop as loot when defeated.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Encounters are therefore always unique, often surprising, and sometimes hilarious!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Beware though, enemies grow stronger too as you unlock more powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Inspired by <i>Into the Breach</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>, enemies make their intents known, allowing you to plan and outmaneuver them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.poster.avif?t=1753466427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.webm?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.mp4?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Adapt on the fly by tossing the perfect item to an ally in a critical moment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Or maybe just lob a bomb toward your enemies?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A simple and intuitive interface that welcomes players new to the genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlimited undos for carefree experimentation and those misclick moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An optional Auto-Battle button in case your brain has melted from all that strategizing. Also useful for discovering interesting moves. (Kinda like ChatGPT for turn-based tactics.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No story or cut-scenes; every moment an interesting decision!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the BOSSFIGHT when you win!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenge yourself (literally!) as you try to one-up your previous party each time though this sidescrolling turn-based roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Outsmart enemy intents in a series of tactical combat encounters while assembling synergistic item builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover the nuances in this highly replayable game, lovingly designed to minimize complexity and maximize depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.poster.avif?t=1753466427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.webm?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.mp4?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Items, items, items!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In Bossfight Tactics, it's all about the items; there are no character classes/abilities/stats/etc!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Items let you move, attack, gain passive abilities and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With 100+ unique and quirky items, there are tons of emergent interactions to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.poster.avif?t=1753466427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.webm?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.mp4?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Instead of fixed movesets, enemies are equipped with random items which drop as loot when defeated.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Encounters are therefore always unique, often surprising, and sometimes hilarious!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Beware though, enemies grow stronger too as you unlock more powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Inspired by <i>Into the Breach</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>, enemies make their intents known, allowing you to plan and outmaneuver them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.poster.avif?t=1753466427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.webm?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.mp4?t=1753466427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Adapt on the fly by tossing the perfect item to an ally in a critical moment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Or maybe just lob a bomb toward your enemies?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A simple and intuitive interface that welcomes players new to the genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlimited undos for carefree experimentation and those misclick moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An optional Auto-Battle button in case your brain has melted from all that strategizing. Also useful for discovering interesting moves. (Kinda like ChatGPT for turn-based tactics.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No story or cut-scenes; every moment an interesting decision!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become the BOSSFIGHT when you win! Assemble quirky item synergies and outsmart enemy intents in a series of turn-based combat. Bossfight Tactics distills a deep, tactical experience into a cute and approachable roguelike!",
